  {
   "beatId": "beat-N02",
   "sentenceId": "N02",
   "outputStartMs": 7090,
   "outputEndMs": 15060,
   "narrationText": "这，就是 MS-06 扎古II——一台证明量产机也能成为传奇的机体。",
